### CinemaAbyss Proxy Service HTTP Tests
### RFC 2616 compliant HTTP requests for testing Proxy Service
### Base URL: http://localhost:8000

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@apiPath = /api

### ===========================================
### Health Check Tests
### ===========================================

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### ===========================================
### Movies API via Proxy (Load Balanced)
### ===========================================

### Get All Movies via Proxy
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### Get Movie by ID via Proxy
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies?id=1
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### Create Movie via Proxy
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

{
  "title": "Proxy Test Movie",
  "description": "A movie created via proxy service",
  "rating": 9.0,
  "genres": ["Action", "Proxy"]
}

###

### ===========================================
### Users API via Proxy (Direct to Monolith)
### ===========================================

### Get All Users via Proxy
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/users
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### Get User by ID via Proxy
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/users?id=1
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### Create User via Proxy
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

{
  "username": "proxy_user",
  "email": "proxy@example.com"
}

###

### ===========================================
### Load Balancing Tests
### ===========================================

### Multiple requests to test load balancing
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0
X-Request-ID: lb-test-001

###

GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0
X-Request-ID: lb-test-002

###

GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0
X-Request-ID: lb-test-003

###

GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0
X-Request-ID: lb-test-004

###

GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0
X-Request-ID: lb-test-005

###

### ===========================================
### Performance Tests
### ===========================================

### Rapid sequential requests
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0
X-Request-ID: perf-test-001

###

GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0
X-Request-ID: perf-test-002

###

GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0
X-Request-ID: perf-test-003

###

### ===========================================
### Error Handling Tests
### ===========================================

### Invalid endpoint (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/invalid-endpoint
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### Invalid method for endpoint
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

{
  "title": "Invalid Method Test"
}

###

### ===========================================
### HTTP Method Tests (RFC 2616 Compliance)
### ===========================================

### OPTIONS request
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### HEAD request
HEAD {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### ===========================================
### Header Tests
### ===========================================

### Test with custom headers
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0
X-Custom-Header: test-value
X-Request-Source: http-test-suite
X-Test-Case: proxy-header-validation

###

### Test with various Accept headers
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies
Accept: application/json, application/xml, text/plain
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### Test with Authorization header
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0
Authorization: Bearer test-token-12345

###
